":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-11-12T15:43:44Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T10:02:24Z","closed_at":"2024-11-14T10:02:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - macOS 15.0.1 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - Apple M3 Max - Apple M3 Max (14 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe editor will hang indefinitely when both an AspectRatioContainer and a TextureRect have modes doing calculations on the width or height.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n**From a brand new project**\r\n1. Make a new scene, pick the \"User Interface\" root node\r\n2. Add an AspectRatioContainer as a child\r\n3. Change its ratio to anything that's not 1 (e.g. 0.5), and its Stretch Mode to \"Width Controls Height\"\r\n4. Add a TextureRect as a child of the AspectRatioController\r\n5. Give the TextureRect a texture (anything)\r\n6. Change its Expand Mode to \"Fit Width\"\r\n\r\n**From the MRP below**\r\nFocus on the TextureRect and change its Expand Mode to \"Fit Width\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP-AspectRatioCrash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17718934/MRP-AspectRatioCrash.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousand